---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="About — Thuan Nabuco" description="About Thuan Nabuco, a software engineer focused on backend systems, product thinking, and execution for digital products." lang="en">
  <section class="py-10 md:py-14">
    <div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-[0.9fr_1.1fr] lg:items-start">
      <div class="lattice-card p-6 md:p-8">
        <p class="lattice-label mb-4">About</p>
        <h1 class="text-4xl font-black uppercase tracking-[-0.06em] text-stone-900">I build systems that are useful, reliable, and easy to trust.</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-6 text-base leading-8 text-stone-600">
        <p>
          I’m a software engineer working across backend systems, product thinking, and digital execution. I enjoy the part of engineering where technical decisions have real-world consequences: system boundaries, API design, performance, reliability, and product clarity.
        </p>
        <p>
          My work sits between code and product. I like helping teams turn complexity into maintainable systems, and I care about the operational realities behind shipping software: observability, ownership, clear interfaces, and strong defaults.
        </p>
        <p>
          I’m especially interested in roles where engineering depth, product thinking, and execution speed all matter. That is the space where the best software usually gets built.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-6 md:py-10">
    <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="lattice-card p-6">
        <p class="lattice-label">Strengths</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-600">
          <li>• Backend systems and service architecture</li>
          <li>• API design and product-oriented engineering</li>
          <li>• Product thinking with execution discipline</li>
          <li>• Systems clarity, maintainability, and performance</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="lattice-card p-6">
        <p class="lattice-label">How I work</p>
        <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-sm leading-7 text-stone-600">
          <li>• Build simple systems that scale without unnecessary complexity</li>
          <li>• Clarify tradeoffs before implementation starts</li>
          <li>• Prefer durable patterns over brittle shortcuts</li>
          <li>• Ship product value with strong engineering fundamentals</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
